# /opt/autodev/instance/.env (owner autodev, mode 0600). Fill in ONLY after the decisions are made.
# Never commit this file or paste its values into chat. One of the two Claude options below, not both.

# Claude: EITHER a dedicated Console API key with a provider-side monthly spend limit ...
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ... OR leave it unset and sign in to the unmodified Claude Code as the autodev user (subscription).

# Linear personal API key (Read + Write, restricted to the mapped teams)
# LINEAR_API_KEY=

# Token of the GitHub *bot* account. For a personal-account repo where the bot is a collaborator, this must be
# a classic token with `repo` scope (fine-grained tokens don't support collaborator access); see docs/SETUP.md §3.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Optional
# AUTODEV_DASHBOARD_TOKEN=
# AUTODEV_REPORT_WEBHOOK=
